  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>[поддерживаемые версии]</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>=&gt; mc 1.19.2 <span style=\"font-size:14px\">(устаревшая версия)</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>=&gt; mc 1.19.4 <span style=\"font-size:14px\">(устаревшая версия)</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>=&gt; mc 1.20.1</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>[требования]</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>=&gt; мод Player Animator</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>(<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator</a>)</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>[новые предметы]</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-size:18px\">=&gt; шаблон</strong></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-size:18px\">=&gt; доспехи Укуна</strong></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-size:18px\">=&gt; посох Укуна</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/997/780/2024-10-24_01.png\" width=\"272\" height=\"176\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>[рецепт]</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/997/781/2024-10-24_01.png\" width=\"332\" height=\"155\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/997/782/2024-10-24_01.png\" width=\"332\" height=\"161\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>[внешний вид]</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/997/783/2024-10-24_01.png\" width=\"495\" height=\"316\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>[описание]</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/997/784/2024-10-24_01.png\" width=\"499\" height=\"186\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>[навык 1]</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Наносит удар по цели правой кнопкой мыши, вызывая 10 (+12% от макс. здоровья цели) урона.</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/997/787/2024-10-24_01.png\" width=\"501\" height=\"521\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>[навык 2]</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Поднимает в воздух окружающие сущности и наносит 8 (+уровень зачарования «Заклятие нежити») урона.</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/997/786/2024-10-24_01.png\" width=\"492\" height=\"310\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/997/785/2024-10-24_01.png\" width=\"492\" height=\"246\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>[параметры конфигурации]</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/997/788/capture.png\" width=\"496\" height=\"226\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>[совместимость]</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>=&gt; мод Better Combat</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>=&gt; мод Epic Fight (+ мод Weapons of Miracles)</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>[несовместимость</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>]</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>=&gt; мод OptiFine</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
